      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-132097\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">12.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"132097\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Which of the following is equivalent to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"212\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2261\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.222em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>5</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mod</mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>?</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sun, Oct 11th @ 3:58 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:12</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
