      "dom_id": "step-129883",
      "name": "Example: \n                    Using the Addition and Subtraction Properties",
      "problem": "If $x + 8 \\equiv 11\\: (\\textrm{mod}\\,15),$ find an equivalent statement where $x$ is isolated.",
      "worked_solution": "The addition property of congruences states that \n\n$$\na\\equiv b  \\quad \\Longleftrightarrow\\quad a+c\\equiv b+c \\qquad (\\textrm{mod}\\,n).\n$$\n\nSimilarly, the subtraction property states that\n\n$$\na\\equiv b \\quad \\Longleftrightarrow\\quad a-c\\equiv b-c \\qquad (\\textrm{mod}\\,n).\n$$\n\nWe use the subtraction property to subtract $8$ from both sides of the given congruence, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+8 & ≡11\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,15) \\\\ x+8-8 & ≡11-8\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,15) \\\\ x & ≡3\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,15)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": null,
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"step-129883\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"129883\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"14580\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-129883\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Using the Addition and Subtraction Properties</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"129883\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n             