    {
      "dom_id": "step-129888",
      "name": "Example: \n                    Identifying Integers That Are Congruent to Zero Modulo N",
      "problem": "Which of the following numbers is congruent to $0$ modulo $18?$\n\n- $-45$\n\n- $42$\n\n- $-54$",
      "worked_solution": "First, recall that  \n\n$$\na \\equiv 0 \\quad (\\textrm{mod}\\,n) \\qquad \\Longleftrightarrow \\qquad a = kn,\n$$\n\nwhere $k\\in\\mathbb Z.$ In other words, when $a$ is divided by $n,$ there is no remainder. This means that any integer multiple of $18$ is congruent to $0$ modulo $18.$\n\nSo, since $18\\,|\\,(-54),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n-54 \\equiv (-3) \\cdot {\\color{blue}18} \\equiv (-3)\\cdot 0\\equiv 0 \\quad (\\text{mod}\\:{\\color{blue}18}).\n$$\n\nNone of the other options are multiples of $18.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": null,
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"step-129888\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"129888\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"14582\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-129888\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-7\">Identifying Integers That Are Congruent to Zero Modulo N</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"129888\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n  