    {
      "dom_id": "step-129892",
      "name": "Example: \n                    Simplifying Congruences",
      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to $x \\equiv 23\\: (\\textrm{mod}\\,6)?$ \n\n- $x \\equiv 2 \\quad (\\textrm{mod}\\,6)$\n\n- $x \\equiv 3 \\quad (\\textrm{mod}\\,6)$\n\n- $x \\equiv 5 \\quad (\\textrm{mod}\\,6)$",
      "worked_solution": "When we add zero to both sides of a congruence modulo $n$, we can form an equivalent congruence by writing zero as an integer multiple of $n.$ This works because every integer multiple of $n$ is congruent to zero modulo $n.$\n\nIn our case, we add zero to both sides of the congruence and then use the fact that  ${\\color{blue}6} \\cdot (-3) \\equiv 0 \\: (\\text{mod}\\:{\\color{blue}6})$ to rewrite the right-hand side, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+0 & ≡23+0\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,6) \\\\ x & ≡23+0\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,6) \\\\  & ≡23+6\\cdot (-3)\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,6) \\\\  & ≡23-18\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,6) \\\\  & ≡5\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,6)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": null,
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"step-129892\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"129892\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"14585\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-129892\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-11\">Simplifying Congruences</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"129892\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n 