,-3327)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(389,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-6D\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"833\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-64\" x=\"1334\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"2446\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"2947\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"  </p>\n\n            </div>           \n        </div>",
